{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/663334-random-name-generator","id":663334,"title":"Random Name Generator","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-09-13T12:19:13-07:00","id":663334,"title":"Random Name Generator","content":"<a href=\"https://orteil.dashnet.org/randomgen/?gen=idbeAjts\" target=\"_blank\">BEHOLD!</a><br /> For those cool &quot;word-salad&quot; names that Creationites love so much. Voidstate's name generator has been down for a while, but I found a name generator based on it, which was broken but had the script all laid out. I didn't copy it 100% exactly, I've made some changes and added more vocabulary.<br /> <br /> For Dynast names I made this: <a href=\"https://orteil.dashnet.org/randomgen/?gen=AYsfB34A\" target=\"_blank\">https://orteil.dashnet.org/randomgen/?gen=AYsfB34A</a><br /> and I also found this: <a href=\"http://tobias.bindslet.dk/names/index.php\" target=\"_blank\">http://tobias.bindslet.dk/names/index.php</a><br /> <br /> Random Phonetic names: <a href=\"https://orteil.dashnet.org/randomgen/?gen=K4rM3Z41\" target=\"_blank\">https://orteil.dashnet.org/randomgen/?gen=K4rM3Z41</a><br /> Warning: it is not designed to produce familiar-looking European or East Asian names.<br /> <br /> Old Realm names:<br /> Since Old Realm names and words are a mishmash of so many real-world languages, these generators are based on my own personal statistical interpretation of Old Realm, which I started working out <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/613448-old-realm-language\">here</a> with help from <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6999-nitai\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"6999\" data-vbnamecard=\"6999\">nitai</a>.<br /> &gt; Celestial, Terrestrial, and ancient Old Realm: <a href=\"https://orteil.dashnet.org/randomgen/?gen=FaifGb1M\" target=\"_blank\">https://orteil.dashnet.org/randomgen/?gen=FaifGb1M</a><br /> &gt; Infernal Old Realm: <a href=\"https://orteil.dashnet.org/randomgen/?gen=EcFUJXMw\" target=\"_blank\">https://orteil.dashnet.org/randomgen/?gen=EcFUJXMw</a><br /> <br /> __________________________________________________ _________________________________<br /> Some (ok, a lot) of the results are strange or silly, but what can I do... they're random scripts.<br /> <br /> Please share your comments and criticisms. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> __________________________________________________ _________________________________<br /> URLS are updated and should be working again. If they fail, make sure they're going to https.<br /> <br /> NEW!<br /> Artifact description generator: <a href=\"https://orteil.dashnet.org/randomgen/?gen=98pbXTPq\" target=\"_blank\">https://orteil.dashnet.org/randomgen/?gen=98pbXTPq</a><br /> Tells you what the artifact looks like and what it's made of ... but not what it is or what it does. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> (Obviously this one's unfinished.)<br /> <br /> NEW! 12/2021<br /> Dragon King name generator: <a href=\"https://orteil.dashnet.org/randomgen/?gen=LwePLTEY\" target=\"_blank\">https://orteil.dashnet.org/randomgen/?gen=LwePLTEY</a><br /> There are very few canon names in High Holy Speech, so this one is a bit odd, but it does make names (or words) that fit alongside the canon names.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"left\"><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">She/Her. I am literal-minded and write literally. If I don't say something explicitly, please never assume I implied it. The only exception is if I try to make a joke.</span></span></span></div> <span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">My point of view may be different from yours but is equally valid.</span></span></span><br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1x1ycoxJF0G9niMt5D3Pp7owZ7tw8AJvL?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted-cWoD-ArM url mega-library</a>. Exalted <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/663334-random-name-generator\" target=\"_blank\">name-generators</a>.","edited":{"userid":896,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/896-erinys","user":"Erinys","date":". 03-12-2021, 01:49 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":16}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/896-erinys","name":"Erinys","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar896_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4235"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-13T12:34:02-07:00","id":663389,"title":"","content":"You rock!<br /> <br /> Look at these names!<br /> <span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:Oswald\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Ruin</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:Oswald\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Blessed Number One Serf of the Seas</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:Oswald\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Jewel</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:Oswald\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Brook</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:Oswald\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Mighty Moostone Walrus Sister of the Elder Wasteland</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:Oswal